Production Inventory Manager v1.1d
c BelaOkuma 2017-2026
only compatible with SMS v1.4!

### developed with MDK2 and claude ###

new in update 1.1d:
 - massive code overhaul
 - option ShowNetwork (default off): shows the scripts of the
   connected grids on the PB
 - all items are collected from untagged containers and
   connectors (options collect_all_... removed),
   use (sms,keep) to keep the items in a container
 - vanilla fixes:
   - pistols and rocket launchers are counted correctly
   - flare gun and fireworks can be autocrafted again
   - medkit and powerkit added
 - updated mod support:
   - Deuterium Fusion Reactors mod
 - removed mod support: 
   - Sigma Draconis Core (no longer on the workshop)
   - HSR (discontinued)
   - Industrial Overhaul Water (no blueprints anymore)

